from pathlib import Path
import html
P=Path(__file__).resolve().parent
assets=[]
for folder in ['marks','icons','avatars','lockups','social','banners','fonts']:
 links=''.join(f'<li><a href="{p.relative_to(P)}">{html.escape(p.name)}</a></li>' for p in sorted((P/folder).glob('*')) if p.is_file())
 assets.append(f'<details><summary>{folder} — individual downloads</summary><ul>{links}</ul></details>')
page='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Storyfeed — current brand kit</title><style>@font-face{font-family:Instrument;src:url(fonts/InstrumentSans.ttf)}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{font-family:Instrument,system-ui;margin:0;background:#faf6ef;color:#28231f}main{max-width:1120px;padding:32px;margin:auto}h1{font-size:36px}h2{margin-top:48px}a{color:#356f78}nav{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.dark{background:#1b1b1f;padding:12px}.controls{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}select,button{font:inherit;padding:8px}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #438d98;outline-offset:3px}.mark{width:180px}.compact{width:255px;max-width:100%}summary{padding:12px;cursor:pointer}iframe{display:block;border:1px solid #8eb8bd;width:100%;height:720px}li{overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(max-width:650px){main{padding:18px}.pair{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style><main><h1>storyfeed · current brand kit</h1><p>Selected stacked-card identity, refreshing activities, and centered social artwork.</p><nav><a href="downloads/storyfeed-current-kit.zip" download>Download complete ZIP</a><a href="README.md">Use & provenance</a><a href="#identity">Identity</a><a href="#social">Social</a><a href="#motion">Motion</a><a href="#banner">README banner</a><a href="#assets">All downloads</a></nav><h2 id="identity">Identity</h2><p>Single ink is the baseline. Duotone treatments remain labelled comparisons.</p><div class="controls"><label for="colour">Wordmark treatment</label><select id="colour"><option value="baseline">Single ink — baseline</option><option value="feed-teal">Teal feed — comparison</option><option value="story-teal">Teal story — comparison</option><option value="feed-orange">Orange feed — comparison</option><option value="teal-pair">Related teals — comparison</option></select></div><div class="pair"><div><img class="mark" src="marks/mark-light.svg" alt="Storyfeed mark on light"><img id="lock-light" src="lockups/horizontal-baseline-light.svg" alt="Lowercase Storyfeed horizontal lockup"></div><div class="dark"><img class="mark" src="marks/mark-dark.svg" alt="Storyfeed mark on dark"><img id="lock-dark" src="lockups/horizontal-baseline-dark.svg" alt="Lowercase Storyfeed horizontal dark lockup"></div></div><h2 id="social">Current centered social artwork</h2><p>Iteration10 · single ink · canonical 2400×1200, cropped 1200×630 and actual 255px thumbnail. Genuine website renderer with deterministic fixture data.</p><div class="pair"><div><a href="social/baseline-light.jpg"><img src="social/baseline-light.png" alt="Light canonical social"></a><img src="social/baseline-light-crop.png" alt="Light social crop"><img class="compact" src="social/baseline-light-crop.png" alt="Light social at 255 pixels"></div><div><a href="social/baseline-dark.jpg"><img src="social/baseline-dark.png" alt="Dark canonical social"></a><img src="social/baseline-dark-crop.png" alt="Dark social crop"><img class="compact" src="social/baseline-dark-crop.png" alt="Dark social at 255 pixels"></div></div><p><a href="harness/site/">Inspect unfaded native feed fixture</a></p><h2 id="motion">Refreshing activity queue</h2><p>Nine activity motifs advance through three cards. Pause, replay and step controls are in the review; reduced motion shows the complete selected still.</p><p><a href="motion/index.html">Open motion review</a> · <a href="motion/hero.html">Open hero context</a></p><iframe title="Storyfeed activity queue review" src="motion/index.html" loading="lazy"></iframe><h2 id="banner">README banner · 2× export</h2><p>1600px export displayed at 800px. Fixed outlined type; three-second holds, .75-second advances. <a href="banners/storyfeed-static-light.svg">Static SVG</a> · <a href="readme-preview.html">GitHub-rendered README preview</a></p><picture><source media="(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)" srcset="banners/storyfeed-static-light.png"><img src="banners/storyfeed-animated-light.gif" width="800" height="214" alt="Storyfeed — Activity streams for Laravel. New activities advance through a three-card feed."></picture><div class="dark"><picture><source media="(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)" srcset="banners/storyfeed-static-dark.png"><img src="banners/storyfeed-animated-dark.gif" width="800" height="214" alt="Storyfeed refreshing feed, dark banner"></picture></div><h2 id="assets">Individual assets and source</h2>'''+''.join(assets)+'''<p><a href="manifest.json">Distribution manifest</a> · <a href="source/frozen-assets.json">Frozen source hashes</a> · <a href="fonts/OFL.txt">Font licence</a></p></main><script>document.querySelector('#colour').addEventListener('change',e=>{for(const t of ['light','dark'])document.querySelector('#lock-'+t).src='lockups/horizontal-'+e.target.value+'-'+t+'.svg'})</script></html>'''
(P/'index.html').write_text(page)
